{"id":"632927","name":"醋汁皮蛋","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632927/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"8个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青椒放入热锅中干煸。","img":"images/632927/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"皮蛋去掉皮洗净。","img":"images/632927/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把皮蛋切成块放入盘中。","img":"images/632927/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"干煸软的青椒捞出。","img":"images/632927/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把青椒切碎放入盐码味。","img":"images/632927/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把青椒碎放在皮蛋上。","img":"images/632927/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋上醋即可。","img":"images/632927/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}